# Next.js App Router Architecture

- Place routes under `src/app`.
- Use Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed.
- Keep route-level SEO in `metadata`/`generateMetadata`.
- Keep data shaping on server and pass minimal props to client components.
- Co-locate route-specific UI in the route folder; move reusable pieces to `src/components`.

## Quick Example

```tsx
import type { Metadata } from "next";

export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: "Athlete Profile",
  description: "High-performance athlete website",
};
```
